return ['domain'=>'zinn-cache','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'so_SO','project-id-version'=>'zinn-cache','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-02T07:33:02+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-02T07:33:02+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Cache'=>'Zinn® Cache','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache','For sites hosted with Zinn Digital®. Controls the page cache your Zinn® server already provides — smart auto-purge on content change, remote purge from your Zinn® dashboard, a Redis object-cache toggle, safe WordPress/WooCommerce exclusions, and one-click admin login. This is a cache controller, not a cache engine. Hosting elsewhere? Install Zinn® Cache Engine instead.'=>'Goobaha lagu martigeliyo Zinn Digital®. Waxay maamushaa kaydka meel-ku-gaarka ah (cache) ee uu server-kaaga Zinn® horay u bixiyo — nadiifin toos ah oo caqli leh marka ay nuxurku isbedesho, nadiifin fog oo ka timid dashboard-kaaga Zinn®, badhanka shidista iyo daminta ee Redis object-cache, ka reebitaan ammaan ah WordPress/WooCommerce, iyo hal-guji-gal ah oo maamule ah. Kani waa kontoroolka kaydka, ee ma aha mashiinka kaydka. Meel kale ma ku martigelineysaa? Ku rakib Zinn® Cache Engine beddelkeeda.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','You are not allowed to purge the cache.'=>'Uma oggola inaad nadiifiso kaydka.','Cache purge requested.'=>'Nadiifinta kaydka ayaa la codsaday.','Zinn® Cache: another object-cache drop-in is installed, so the Redis object cache is not managed by this plugin.'=>'Zinn® Cache: shayga kaydinta shayga kale waa la rakibay, markaa Redis kaydinta shayga looma maamulo plugin-kan.','Full-page cache (LiteSpeed)'=>'Kaydka bogga oo dhan (LiteSpeed)','Enable LSCache control'=>'Shid xakameynta LSCache','Send LiteSpeed cache-control and tag headers on cacheable pages.'=>'U dir madaxyada xakameynta iyo tags-ka kaydka LiteSpeed bogagga la kaydin karo.','Public cache lifetime (seconds)'=>'Nolosha kaydka guud (ilbiriqsiyo)','Object cache (Redis)'=>'Kaydka walxaha (Redis)','Enable Redis object cache'=>'Shid kaydka walxaha Redis','Install the Redis object-cache drop-in (requires the phpredis extension).'=>'Rakib drop-in-ka kaydka walxaha Redis (wuxuu u baahan yahay eextenshanka phpredis).','Redis host'=>'Martida Redis','Redis port'=>'Boortiga Redis','Redis database'=>'Xogtaanka Redis','Redis key prefix'=>'Horgale furaha Redis','Automatic purging'=>'Nadiifinta tooska ah','Smart auto-purge'=>'Nadiifin caqli badan oo toos ah','Purge affected pages automatically when content changes.'=>'Si toos ah u nadiifi bogagga saameeyay marka nuxurku isbeddelo.','Purge on updates'=>'Nadiifi marka la cusboonaysiiyo','Purge everything after core, plugin, or theme updates.'=>'Nadiifi wax kasta ka dib cusboonaysiinta core, balaqaig, ama theme.','Cache exclusions'=>'Ka-saarista kaydka','Sensible WordPress and WooCommerce defaults are always applied (cart, checkout, my-account, logged-in and session pages are never cached). Add extra rules below, one per line.'=>'Waxaa had iyo jeer la adeegsadaa qiyamka caadiga ah ee macquulka ah ee WordPress iyo WooCommerce (gaariga, lacag-bixinta, my-account, iyo bogagga qofka soo galay iyo kuwa fadhiga weligood lama kaydiyo). Ku dar xeerar dheeraad ah oo hoose, mid kasta sadar.','Exclude URL paths (prefix match)'=>'Ka reeb waddooyinka URL (isku-mid horgale)','Exclude query keys'=>'Ka reeb furayaasha weydiimaha','Exclude cookie name prefixes'=>'Ka reeb horgalayaasha magaca cookie-ga','Maintenance'=>'Dayactir','Purge everything now'=>'Nadiifi wax kasta hadda','detected'=>'la ogaaday','not detected'=>'lama ogaan','phpredis extension missing'=>'eextenshanka phpredis ayaa maqan','active'=>'firfircoon','inactive'=>'aan firfircoonayn','LiteSpeed cache:'=>'Kaydka LiteSpeed:','Redis object cache:'=>'Kaydka walxaha Redis:','The Redis PHP extension (phpredis) is not available on this server, so the object cache cannot be enabled.'=>'Eextenshanka Redis PHP (phpredis) kuma jiro server-kan, sidaas darteed kaydka walxaha lama shidi karo.','Another object-cache drop-in is already installed. Remove it before enabling the Zinn® object cache.'=>'Drop-in-ka object-cache kale ayaa horay loo sii rakibay. Ka saar kahor intaadan awood-siin Zinn® object cache.','Could not write the Redis connection configuration file.'=>'Faylka habaynta xiriirka Redis lama qori karin.','The bundled object-cache drop-in could not be read.'=>'Drop-in-ka kaydka walxaha ee la keydiyay lama akhrin karin.','Could not install the object-cache drop-in into wp-content.'=>'Drop-in-ka kaydka walxaha laguma rakibi karin wp-content.','Could not remove the object-cache drop-in.'=>'Drop-in-ka kaydka walxaha lama saari karin.','The WordPress filesystem is not writable, so the object-cache drop-in could not be managed.'=>'Nidaamka faylalka WordPress lama qori karo, sidaas darteed drop-in-ka kaydka walxaha lama maareyn karin.','This one-click login link is not valid any more. Links expire after a couple of minutes and can only be used once — open your site from the Zinn® dashboard again to get a fresh one.'=>'Xiriirkan gelitaanka ee hal-guji ah mar dambe ma ansax aha. Xiriiriyayaashu waxay dhacayaan daqiiqado kadib waxaana la isticmaali karaa hal mar oo keliya — ka fur boggaaga dashboard-ka Zinn® mar labaad si aad u hesho mid cusub.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Fiiri qoraallada sii-daynta ee Zinn Digital®.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Cusboonaysiinta la soo dejiyay waxay ku guuldareysatay hubinta dhammaystirnaanteeda, lamana rakibin.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — hagayaasha iyo adeegyada','User guides'=>'Hagayaasha isticmaalaha','Read the %s user guide'=>'Akhri %s hagaha isticmaalaha','Hide this'=>'Qari tan','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Hosingka Zinn® ee WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, keymoimidaha maalinlaha ah, haajiridda bilaashka ah iyo guddiga kontoroolka ee loogu talagalay dadka wada in ka badan hal goob.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Suuqa Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Iibso oo iibi mareegaha, domaynada iyo meelaha xiriirinta la dhisay, iyadoo lacagta si ammaan ah loo hayo ilaa labada dhinac ay ka qanacayaan.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — kireyso dadkan u shaqaysta xirfad ahaan','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Suuqa kala iibsiga ee caalamiga ah: ka baadh in ka badan 10,000 adeeg oo diyaar ah oo ka yimid qoraayaasha, naqshadeeyayaasha, horumariyayaasha iyo khuburada SEO, ama soo dhig mashruuc oo u oggolow inay dalabkooda soo gudbiyaan.']];